===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|schale}}, from {{inh|de|goh|scala}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*skalō}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|schaal||shell}} and {{cog|en|shale}}. Also related with {{m+|nl|schil}}, {{m+|en|shell}}.

====Noun====
{{de-noun|f|dim=^chen}}

# [[bowl]]
# [[scale]], [[dish]] 
# [[peel]]; [[husk]]; [[shell]] {{gloss|outer layer}}
# [[shell]]; [[scallop]]
# {{lb|de|hunting}} [[hoof]]
# {{lb|de|figurative|colloquial}} (fine) [[clothing]]
#: {{coi|de|sich in '''Schale''' werfen|to dress up}}

